    "updated_at": "2023-02-24T15:19:50Z",
    "body": "Not sure if it's immediately relevant, but I just encountered an interesting corner case: pointing an `<input type=\"file\" webkitdirectory=\"\" />` at an empty directory causes no `change` event. Should it cause a `cancel` event? ",
    "author_association": "NONE",
