    "updated_at": "2023-02-24T15:20:47Z",
    "body": "I should also note that Chromium uses the [same code](https://source.chromium.org/search?q=FileInputType::FilesChosen&sq=&ss=chromium%2Fchromium%2Fsrc) to handle both receiving dropped files and a result from the file chooser.  So [fixing](https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/4048886) the latter to fire `cancel` events in some cases will also fix the former at the same time.\r\n\r\n(Not sure about the `webkitdirectory` case... but the above CL *might* change that behavior.)",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
